<urn:atm:triage:finding/AW2-QA-B1>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AW2-QA-B1" ;
  triage:title "SqliteDiagnosticTimeline::prune runs DELETEs on a pooled control-path connection instead of the single-writer lane; DIAGNOSTIC_PRUNE_CHECK_EVERY auto-prune not implemented" ;
  triage:description "qa-pr1179-r3 (req-qa + ruthless-boundary-qa, msg 01M1QQPCZVHYSQ37GQMXKKQMFS) at 0e825b75e: prune (diagnostic_timeline.rs ~113-120) executes DELETEs via SharedDb::with_transaction -> control_path_pool::checkout, a separate pooled connection outside the writer priority lane; writer/ops.rs has only a RecordDiagnostics WriteOp and no prune variant. Contradicts sprint-AW.2 deliverable 8 (prune runs as a RecordDiagnostics-lane op) and the module's single-writer rationale. The DIAGNOSTIC_PRUNE_CHECK_EVERY auto-prune trigger is not implemented anywhere. Retention work was still in progress at this tip per arch-ctm." ;
